name=Zomboid Fixes B42.20
id=ZomboidFixesB42
author=Tien
poster=poster.png
icon=icon.png
description=A collection of fixes for Build 42.20, mostly for multiplayer.
description=- Fast Timed Actions makes item transfers and grabs from the ground quick in multiplayer, falling back to a normal transfer when the server cannot make a quick one.
description=- Changing an animal's gender now swaps the animal's model and type with it, and sticks for everyone.
description=- The foraging debug menu works, and added icons can be picked up.
description=- Item editor changes save for items anywhere, not just your own inventory.
description=- The debug Add Fluid option fills rain collectors and other fluid containers for real, and everyone sees it.
description=- The hutch debug Remove Egg option gives you the egg in multiplayer instead of losing it (beta).
description=- Admins with Fast Move on no longer die from falls on stairs.
description=- The admin tag shows for every admin cheat, or never, or as in vanilla.
description=- Items with negative weight are deleted automatically.
description=- Clothing wear down rework: zombie attacks stopped by clothing or armor wear it down in multiplayer like in single player, and destroyed clothing falls off for everyone and stays destroyed.
description=- Metal shin armor run speeds follow the thigh armor's pattern: articulated faster, spiked slower.
description=- Chickens deleted by the game when they finish laying in a hutch are put back.
description=- Hutches and nest boxes get dirty four times more slowly, adjustable.
description=- Grab Eggs takes every egg in the nest box, also with Timed Action Instant or fast forward (beta).
description=- Guns of Marz attachment tooltips wrap at 200 characters by default instead of stretching across the screen.
description=- Guns of Marz guns show the magazine really in them, and its capacity, in their tooltip.
description=- Plysken Attachments Reborn's bag attachment slot box fits the tooltip font size and goes under other mods' tooltip lines.
description=- Running players no longer vault stair railings by accident.
description=- Fast forward in multiplayer, when every player votes for it, with actions, looting and cooking sped up too; right-click a speed to auto fast forward actions longer than 5 seconds.
description=- Grab amount... between Grab one and Grab all takes exactly as many items from a stack as you type.
description=- Empty slices are left out of the firearm radial menu, so it only shows what can be done.
description=- Turbo Game cartridges, batteries, best scores and mood effects work on servers, best scores are kept per console, playing no longer moves your character, and games close near zombies or in the dark.
description=- Admins who join are fully healed and briefly in god mode, so a revived admin does not die again (off by default).
description=- Admins can change any player's body stats (hunger, mood, health, calories, weight and more) like the debug Body panel, and the changes stick for everyone.
description=- Admins can toggle bites, fractures, bleeding and other conditions on any body part of any player from the admin hotbar, heal a part or the body without taking bandages off, and open any nearby player's health window without asking (beta).
description=- Admins can send and stop the chopper from the right-click Debug menu; stopping it ends today's chopper event so it stays gone, and reaches every player, even one who still hears a chopper that already left (beta).
description=- An admin hotbar: one-click shortcuts to every admin tool, each with its own settings, optional extra steps and repeats, opened from the sidebar (single player: with -debug).
description=- Picking a square in the debug Horde Manager or Tile Picker no longer walks your character there.
description=- Finished skill books stay read after relogging, also with the instant actions cheat (beta).
description=- A Full Bright admin power: Always Day plus every room around the admin lit, only the admin sees it.
description=- A God Vehicle admin power: the vehicle the admin sits in never takes damage, uses fuel, loses air or drains its battery.
description=- A No Wear admin power: the admin's weapons, tools and clothing stay at full condition and sharpness, with no holes.
description=- An Endless Supplies admin power: everything with charges the admin carries stays full.
description=- Refill Container works on servers, plus a Reroll button in the loot window for admins.
description=- The admin Server Options window no longer leaves an option's description stuck to the mouse (beta).
description=- Mod options and key bindings of mods that are not loaded are no longer reset or deleted when you save the options (enable this mod in the main menu too).
description=- Vehicle batteries no longer drain twice as fast as intended (beta).
description=- Welding a gas tank still on a vehicle repairs it instead of wasting the materials (beta).
description=- Refuelling a generator takes as long as the fuel that goes in, not the whole can (beta).
description=- Water dispenser bottles can no longer be duplicated (beta).
description=- Make-up you remove or replace in multiplayer is really deleted, and applied make-up stays on (beta).
description=- Medical-checking a player twice no longer resets their hunger, thirst, pain, stress and other stats (beta).
description=- Notebook locks and text are saved on the server in multiplayer (beta).
description=- A removed padlock can be put on again in multiplayer, and its key leaves your key ring (beta).
description=- Faction invitations name the faction, the Manage Inventory title is centred, and crops no longer say there is not enough soil (beta).
description=- Timed actions stuck at 100% are stopped after a while instead of blocking every action after them (beta).
description=- Crafting stations stay usable after something on their tile is removed (beta).
description=- Scrapping a key ring, sack or hollow book no longer deletes what is inside it (beta).
description=- Plank barricades take 2 nails, and barricading stops once you run out of planks (beta).
description=- The daily Mechanics XP limit per vehicle part survives reloads (beta).
description=- Fish fillets and other crafted items show their real values in multiplayer (beta).
description=- A bag's max item size is checked per item: drag a whole stack of magazines into ALICE webbing at once (beta).
description=- Optional: remove the max item size of bags entirely (beta, off by default).
description=- Markings drawn on paper maps are kept in multiplayer (beta).
description=- Read brochures, fliers and maps show on the world map in multiplayer right away (beta).
description=- Admins with Timed Action Instant and the Handy trait build instantly in multiplayer, not after half an hour (beta).
description=- Moderators and custom roles get the world map's admin tools, like Teleport Here, when their role allows it (beta).
description=- Rooms you have seen in multiplayer stay lit after relogging (beta).
description=- Removing bushes and breaking up rocks, ore and stumps wears the tool again, and broken tools are swapped for another (beta).
description=- Removing a bush clears every bush on the square without an error (beta).
description=- Watering a plant in multiplayer no longer waters it twice or empties the can twice as fast (beta).
description=- Other players hear you add ingredients to soups, stews and drinks in multiplayer.
description=- Reloading in multiplayer keeps pace with the animation (no more cut-off pumps or shells running ahead) (beta).
description=- Failed item transfers repair themselves: ghost items on the floor go, items hidden until relogging appear, and stuck transfers retry or end (beta).
description=- Putting an eaten or used-up item back no longer cancels the rest of the queue (beta).
description=- Every click on Craft is queued instead of being ignored while a craft runs (beta).
description=- Rain collectors, drying racks and rain-catching buckets and pots no longer break after a server crash or a restored backup, and broken ones are rebuilt (beta).
description=- Right spiked thigh armor can be moved to the left thigh.
description=- Spiked articulated metal shoulder pads can be smelted.
description=- Plain knee pads and gaiters spawn in pairs.
description=- The full bow tie weighs 0.1 instead of 1.0.
description=- Full chainmail sleeve combat speeds are no longer swapped.
description=- Tire shoulder pads wear evenly and protect their own upper arm.
description=- The sawn-off double barrel shotgun can be repaired.
description=- The sawn-off pump shotgun has its loading and unloading sounds.
description=- The x2 scope fits the pump and sawn-off pump shotguns.
description=- Katanas can be sharpened.
description=- Pasta cooked in a forged pot gives back the forged pot.
description=- Leeks and grapefruits have real nutrition values.
description=- Copper saucepan pasta and rice can be split into bowls.
description=- Clay bowls stay clay bowls when food is split or eaten.
description=- Pumpkin and sunflower seed packets you made give back all 25 seeds.
description=- .44 Magnum boxes weigh what they should.
description=- Small item fixes: the Rangers baseball shirt covers the arms, the red baseball cap stays on like the others, the seafood cooler has sounds, and a few items get their missing names.
description=Must be installed on both the server and clients. Every fix is on by default and can be turned off in the sandbox options; the few that are off by default say so.
modversion=3.1.0
